      "Somali businesses traditionally import goods from Asia through Gulf countries like the UAE, Oman, and Saudi Arabia.",
      "Some traders are now testing direct shipping routes from Asia to bypass the disrupted region.",
      "The disruption may lead to higher costs and delays for the Somali diaspora, affecting remittances and trade."
