    "summary": "Somalia's Minister of Information meets with Turkey's disinformation center coordinator to enhance collaboration on countering false news.",
    "content": "Somalia's Minister of Information, Culture, and Tourism, Abdifatah Sheikh Nur, held a meeting in Ankara with Deniz Demir, the coordinator of the Turkish Presidency's Center for Combating Disinformation and Manipulated Information. The discussion focused on strengthening bilateral cooperation in media and information, particularly on preventing the spread of manipulated information and false news within society.\n\nThe two sides discussed the importance of exchanging expertise, building the capacity of media institutions, and establishing mechanisms to verify information. This meeting is part of ongoing efforts by Somalia and Turkey to deepen their strategic partnership, which has grown significantly in recent years, especially in security, economic development, and humanitarian aid.\n\nTurkey has been a key ally of Somalia, providing military training, development assistance, and support in various sectors. The collaboration on disinformation comes amid global concerns about the impact of fake news on social cohesion and democratic processes. For the Somali diaspora, this cooperation is particularly relevant as many rely on accurate information about events in Somalia, and false news can exacerbate divisions and mislead communities abroad.\n\nThe meeting underscores the growing recognition of the need for reliable information and the role of international partnerships in addressing common challenges. The Somali government has been working to improve media literacy and counter propaganda, especially from extremist groups. This initiative with Turkey could serve as a model for other areas of cooperation.\n\nNo specific agreements or timelines were announced, but both officials expressed commitment to continued dialogue and joint efforts. The outcomes of this meeting are expected to contribute to a more informed public and stronger resilience against disinformation in both countries.\n\nRead the original report from Goobjoog here: https://goobjoog.com/2026/09/13/soomaaliya-iyo-turkiga-oo-iskaashanaya-la-dagaallanka-wararka-been-abuurka-ah/",
